singularity-nx SDK patches 0002-0016 (Singularity and Dead Space 2 fixes on deko3d)

Applied in order from singularity-nx, on top of 0001: occlusion results read as the GPU writes them,
the background shader compiler below the game, WaitMultiple polling every 100 us, drawing while
variants compile off, linear run-time textures, stencil-only depth clears, 32768 image descriptors,
XMA input reported used only after the game is done, depth targets merged after their resolve,
descriptor sets per partial submit, the achievement popup closing itself, emulator and audio thread
cores, vertex buffers read by the shader, prepared shader info in cache/info_shaders.bin.

